  "about": {
    "title": "About",
    "text": "Treatment of Depression “You are not alone” is an educational engineering project.\nA desktop Python app with a Tkinter/CustomTkinter GUI.\nIt combines quick supportive phrases, an LLM-based support chat, and a diary for tracking mood and well-being.\n\nImportant: this app is not a medical device, does not diagnose, and does not replace a doctor/psychologist.\nIf you feel significantly worse, please contact professionals and/or emergency services.\n\nFeatures:\n• Supportive phrases\n• Chat using a generative model\n• Well-being diary\n• User profile\n• Keyboard shortcuts (Ctrl + first letter of the menu item)\n"
  },
